    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705760/extras/a4bf3c3f37d8f68e9c5c85fe1fa7ad95.poster.avif?t=1709323978\" width=500 height=145 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705760/extras/a4bf3c3f37d8f68e9c5c85fe1fa7ad95.webm?t=1709323978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Welcome to the captivating world of <i>Plaquist Simulator</i>, where you embody an apprentice drywaller on a quest for glory and independence. Build partitions, insulate ceilings, manage your stock, and create your own business to become the undisputed master of construction. Take orders, build your team, and learn new professions to diversify your services. Each project is an opportunity to showcase your expertise. So, grab your tool belt, get your screwdriver, and build your empire in the demanding world of Plaquist Simulator!<br>\t<br>\t<strong>Main Features:</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705760/extras/3ec9fae1f97068ac19889d1bc3963914.webp?t=1709323978\" width=463 height=61 /></span><br>Step into the shoes of an apprentice drywaller and master the skills needed to create flawless partitions, insulate ceilings, and much more. Every job is an opportunity to learn and refine your techniques.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705760/extras/f47c81fa39b1afddc75de1c1b30ecd2e.poster.avif?t=1709323978\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705760/extras/f47c81fa39b1afddc75de1c1b30ecd2e.webm?t=1709323978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705760/extras/f47c81fa39b1afddc75de1c1b30ecd2e.mp4?t=1709323978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705760/extras/21c6df4df1e7e856e78bde466132f491.webp?t=1709323978\" width=463 height=61 /></span><br>Tackle diverse challenges, from straightforward projects to more complex ventures. Master the use of tools and materials to ensure impeccable work and satisfy your clients.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705760/extras/d4adf7cf2a8340fa2c246b3e43e9ef7f.poster.avif?t=1709323978\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705760/extras/d4adf7cf2a8340fa2c246b3e43e9ef7f.webm?t=1709323978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705760/extras/d4adf7cf2a8340fa2c246b3e43e9ef7f.mp4?t=1709323978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705760/extras/9df724abb585d77e31f36dbee68bf449.webp?t=1709323978\" width=463 height=61 /></span><br>Decide when to launch your own company. Hire employees, take orders, and make your business thrive. Reputation is crucial in this industry!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705760/extras/4f917958bdf28cb33a6c44777be1f769.poster.avif?t=1709323978\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705760/extras/4f917958bdf28cb33a6c44777be1f769.webm?t=1709323978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705760/extras/4f917958bdf28cb33a6c44777be1f769.mp4?t=1709323978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705760/extras/1f2e5965d80a53f47e1d5e038bc7c104.webp?t=1709323978\" width=463 height=61 /></span><br>Take courses and explore new trades. Become a versatile expert capable of meeting all your clients' demands.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705760/extras/8bf97420cf31476b61d4f8f6c0450efa.poster.avif?t=1709323978\" width=615 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705760/extras/8bf97420cf31476b61d4f8f6c0450efa.webm?t=1709323978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705760/extras/fb10a37564f613ba14855906c0936bd9.webp?t=1709323978\" width=463 height=61 /></span><br>Unlock skills, upgrade your equipment, and gain reputation to climb the ranks of success in the construction world.<br><br><i>Plaster Simulator</i> offers an immersive experience where every detail matters. Get ready to build, learn, and dominate the construction world like never before. Ready to build your future? <i>Plaster Simulator</i> awaits you!",
